"lines": [
{
"text": "Blessed are the poor in spirit",
"start": 17.201,
"end": 19.581
},
{
"text": "Heaven's kingdom belongs to them",
"start": 20.581,
"end": 22.961
},
{
"text": "Blessed are the ones who mourn",
"start": 24.822,
"end": 27.082
},
{
"text": "They will find their comfort",
"start": 27.282,
"end": 29.262
},
{
"text": "Blessed are the gentle",
"start": 32.462,
"end": 33.802
},
{
"text": "They will inherit the earth",
"start": 34.662,
"end": 36.622
},
{
"text": "Those who hunger and thirst for righteousness",
"start": 38.463,
"end": 41.903
},
{
"text": "Will be filled",
"start": 42.283,
"end": 43.283
},
{
"text": "Mercy will meet the merciful",
"start": 45.863,
"end": 48.443
},
{
"text": "Pure hearts will see God",
"start": 49.923,
"end": 52.103
},
{
"text": "Those who make peace will be called God's children",
"start": 53.483,
"end": 59.164
},
{
"text": "Those who suffer for doing right have the kingdom",
"start": 61.344,
"end": 64.144
},
{
"text": "When they speak against you because of Me",
"start": 65.164,
"end": 68.024
},
{
"text": "Rejoice; your reward is in heaven",
"start": 69.445,
"end": 74.285
},
{
"text": "You are the salt of the earth",
"start": 76.365,
"end": 78.845
},
{
"text": "Do not let it lose its taste",
"start": 79.965,
"end": 83.285
},
{
"text": "You are the light for the world",
"start": 84.005,
"end": 86.786
},
{
"text": "A city on a hill cannot hide",
"start": 87.646,
"end": 90.806
},
{
"text": "No one lights a lamp to cover it",
"start": 91.446,
"end": 94.326
},
{
"text": "Set it where the whole house can see",
"start": 95.386,
"end": 98.326
},
{
"text": "Let your good works shine before others",
"start": 99.526,
"end": 102.807
},
{
"text": "And give your Father glory",
"start": 104.847,
"end": 107.787
},
{
"text": "Do not think I came to tear down the Law",
"start": 122.448,
"end": 125.308
},
{
"text": "Or the words the prophets gave",
"start": 126.728,
"end": 128.968
},
{
"text": "I came to bring them to fulfillment",
"start": 130.128,
"end": 132.949
},
{
"text": "Not one small mark will fall away",
"start": 133.849,
"end": 136.689
},
{
"text": "Before all is accomplished",
"start": 137.689,
"end": 139.669
},
{
"text": "You heard the command against murder",
"start": 140.989,
"end": 143.529
},
{
"text": "I tell you anger also faces judgment",
"start": 145.329,
"end": 148.17
},
{
"text": "When you bring your gift to the altar",
"start": 149.09,
"end": 152.13
},
{
"text": "And remember your brother's grievance",
"start": 152.27,
"end": 156.05
},
{
"text": "Leave your gift and go make peace",
"start": 156.73,
"end": 159.35
},
{
"text": "Then come and offer it",
"start": 159.55,
"end": 161.091
},
{
"text": "You are the salt of the earth",
"start": 162.231,
"end": 164.871
},
{
"text": "Do not let it lose its taste",
"start": 165.791,
"end": 168.951
},
{
"text": "You are the light for the world",
"start": 169.831,
"end": 172.531
},
{
"text": "A city on a hill cannot hide",
"start": 173.431,
"end": 176.492
},
{
"text": "No one lights a lamp to cover it",
"start": 177.252,
"end": 180.052
},
{
"text": "Set it where the whole house can see",
"start": 181.192,
"end": 184.152
},
{
"text": "Let your good works shine before others",
"start": 185.312,
"end": 188.572
},
{
"text": "And give your Father glory",
"start": 190.612,
"end": 193.513
},
{
"text": "You heard the command against adultery",
"start": 198.15,
"end": 200.933
},
{
"text": "I tell you lust can sin within the heart",
"start": 201.573,
"end": 204.573
},
{
"text": "If your right eye leads you into sin",
"start": 205.633,
"end": 208.394
},
{
"text": "Tear it out and throw it away",
"start": 209.794,
"end": 211.854
},
{
"text": "Better to lose one part of you",
"start": 212.234,
"end": 215.234
},
{
"text": "Than your whole body be cast into hell",
"start": 215.774,
"end": 218.574
},
{
"text": "You heard the command against false vows",
"start": 219.094,
"end": 222.435
},
{
"text": "But let your yes be yes",
"start": 223.415,
"end": 226.015
},
{
"text": "And let your no be no",
"start": 226.315,
"end": 227.895
},
{
"text": "You heard an eye for an eye",
"start": 229.215,
"end": 230.995
},
{
"text": "But I tell you, turn the other cheek",
"start": 231.075,
"end": 234.295
},
{
"text": "If someone takes your coat",
"start": 235.955,
"end": 237.575
},
{
"text": "Give your cloak as well",
"start": 238.756,
"end": 240.316
},
{
"text": "If you are forced to walk one mile",
"start": 242.156,
"end": 245.056
},
{
"text": "Go with them another",
"start": 245.896,
"end": 247.516
},
{
"text": "Give to the one who asks",
"start": 249.456,
"end": 251.436
},
{
"text": "Do not turn away the one who needs to borrow",
"start": 251.576,
"end": 255.677
},
{
"text": "You heard, love your neighbor and hate your enemy",
"start": 257.057,
"end": 260.677
},
{
"text": "But I tell you, love your enemies",
"start": 261.077,
"end": 264.117
},
{
"text": "Pray for the ones who persecute you",
"start": 264.697,
"end": 267.557
},
{
"text": "Your Father sends sunlight on evil and good",
"start": 268.738,
"end": 272.078
},
{
"text": "And rain on the just and unjust",
"start": 272.638,
"end": 276.078
},
{
"text": "If you love only those who love you",
"start": 276.978,
"end": 279.638
},
{
"text": "What reward is there?",
"start": 280.698,
"end": 282.458
},
{
"text": "Be perfect, as your Father in heaven is perfect",
"start": 284.059,
"end": 289.419
}
],
